'''Purple Seer''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] the [[Random Painted Seers]] recipe in the crafting station or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its purple colored blade takes a jagged shape with black hemispheres varying in different sizes attached to it. The guard and handle are black with neon purple cracks. On the guard are four purple colored eyes of the overseer with black slit pupils, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
*This is one of the six [[Random Painted Seer|Random Painted Seers]], the others being the [[Red Seer]], [[Orange Seer]], [[Yellow Seer]], [[Blue Seer]], and with a very slim chance, [[Chroma Seer]].
*It requires 10 godly [[metals]] and 10 godly [[shards]] to craft it, meaning that players need to salvage at least ten [[Seer|Seers]] and another [[Godly Weapons|godly weapon]] to obtain the required materials.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/156467990/Overseer-Short-Sword Overseer Short Sword].

